<title>MALAYSIA: Rashid Hussain 6-mth net up 13.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Rashid Hussain 6-mth net up 13.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Nov 30, 1996</p>
<p>		  (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 131.38	  vs	   115.55</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 38.0	   vs	    33.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		   287.76	  vs	   184.31</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   203.90	  vs	   173.20</p>
<p>    Minorities less	    4.86	  vs	     1.88</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Rashid Hussain Bhd. It is involved in financial services including stockbroking and banking.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
